### **9. Missing Content Security Policy**
**File:** `/app/server.js:239-294`

The HTML status page is generated inline without CSP headers:

```javascript
res.writeHead(200, { "Content-Type": "text/html; charset=utf-8", "Cache-Control": "no-store" });
res.end(`<!DOCTYPE html>...`);
```

**Risk:** XSS attacks if user-controlled data is ever reflected.

